    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Software </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1530",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»elephant« 2.0« – extremely simple to use",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<ol><li>Selection <strong>of tool type</strong>, e.g., end mill &gt; end mill with corner radius</li><li>Selection of the required <strong>parameters</strong></li><li>Active <strong>measurement</strong>, e.g., cutting contour corner radius</li><li><strong>Measurement results </strong>(19 items, measured fully automatically and without data entry or programming)</li></ol>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/8/csm_software_elephant_3788f74653.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 556
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1527",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»expert« – smart, simple, brilliant",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»expert« is the specialist for measurements on precision tools—based on ZOLLER’s »pilot 4.0« software. The intelligent software generates the optimal measurement sequence based on the selected parameters. Fully automatic, reproducible, and with photorealistic parameter selection. Using check boxes, the parameters to be measured can be selected easily, quickly, and in a tool-specific manner for the measuring program sequence. Simply perform a simple selection of the parameters to be measured and confirm—and the measurement sequence starts immediately.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_software_expert_debaec8152.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1525",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»skp« – Customized, Secure, Exact",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To achieve optimal tool life as well as efficient and precise cutting performance of cutting tools, proper preparation of the cutting edges is crucial. Checks and optimization of cutting edge preparation, as well as reliable and thorough documentation of it, are playing an increasingly important role in this process. ZOLLER »titan«, featuring the CNC-controlled swivelling »zep« measuring sensor and the »skp« software, quickly, non-contact, and fully automatically measures different shapes of cutting edge preparation.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/a/csm_software_skp_8041fbb2c6.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1024,
            "h": 606
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2349",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1529",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c1531",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Groundbreaking Efficiency for Your Grinding Shop </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The greatest potential for efficiency lies outside the grinding machine: ZOLLER Solutions are your key to the future—we help you achieve greater success. After all, those who manufacture faster and more efficiently operate more cost-effectively, enabling them to invest in the future. If economic progress is your goal, then ZOLLER is your partner.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1505",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "extra-large",
    "after": "extra-large"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Software </h2>",
      "body": "<h4>For Maximum Performance</h4>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1503",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "360° Concentricity Check",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To automatically determine the radial run-out of circular surfaces (e.g., tool shanks) and graphically evaluate the entire contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/4/csm_software_rundlaufpruefung_074ba05353.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1522",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Point angle with hollow grinding",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For drills and hollow-ground tool cutting edges, this is determined by contour tracking from the start point (major diameter) to the tool tip or the defined end point.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/8/csm_software_spitzewinkel_f7d99885f3.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1520",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Groove chip space scan",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Automatically scans the groove/chip space contour without contact and represents it graphically.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/c/csm_software_nutscan_4a0f6866e5.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1518",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Radius »Contour« with Graphic",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For the automatic determination of concave and convex radii on the outer contour of tools, including adjustable angular sectors with graphic evaluation.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/0/csm_software_radiuskontur_f2b805a005.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1516",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Rake angle on radius cutters",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Calculates the rake angle within the Radius segment based on the specified angles. Suitable for the cutters, corner cutters and full radius cutters.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/5/csm_software_spanwinkel_1e858e188a.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1514",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Contour profile measurement (»lasso«)«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To scan any tool or workpiece contours and perform a nominal/actual comparison or dimension the contour.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/f/csm_software_lasso_2774d358f7.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1512",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»Metis« Tool Analysis",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Measures and documents any contours, radii, angles, distances, and defects (wear and tear) using incident light.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/2/csm_software_metis_75f5607842.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1510",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Editable »apus« inspection report",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>To represent all measurement results—including designations, nominal values, tolerances, and much more—in a table format with a flexible layout.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/e/csm_software_apus_d369f092b1.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1508",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "ZOLLER »caz«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The virtual measuring machine for the PC workplace, used to externally configure the testing and measurement sequence—including measuring programs, nominal values, and tolerances—based on the 3D model of the tool, even before it is manufactured.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_software_caz_99dbbf50e2.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
